{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Tricky as he explores the surreal dream worlds of the Astral Plane in this colorful 3D platformer visually inspired by consoles of the late 90s and early 2000s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras/710930dc7a75c1837fac599fe500c19e.avif?t=1771983898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras_big/710930dc7a75c1837fac599fe500c19e.avif?t=1771983898 width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last he remembered, Tricky was just dozing off at home. Nothing out of the ordinary. Next thing he knew, he found himself in a surreal dreamscape, unable to wake himself up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After meeting up with some of the dream locals, he learns a few things about his current predicament:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. He's been cursed by a dream wizard who did it for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. The only way to break the curse is to beat him up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The only way to beat him up is to break into his castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras/4e2fc84350a1fd4e7d46d99c21af1066.avif?t=1771983898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras_big/4e2fc84350a1fd4e7d46d99c21af1066.avif?t=1771983898 width=800 height=319 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low poly low res graphics inspired by 6th gen classics of the late 90s and early 00s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive free-form collectathon platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 expansive surreal dream worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 challenge stages offering two different gameplay styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced cutscenes and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Janky expression-based lip syncing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564580?t=1771983898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/35b1ecc95c22f624e8ecf0b88474ae98a4411a3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771983898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/0c4962539da8e238c24bb1c7331b72d65af0a273/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771983898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/0c4962539da8e238c24bb1c7331b72d65af0a273/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771983898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Tricky as he explores the surreal dream worlds of the Astral Plane in this colorful 3D platformer visually inspired by consoles of the late 90s and early 2000s!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras/710930dc7a75c1837fac599fe500c19e.avif?t=1771983898\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564580/extras_big/710930dc7a75c1837fac599fe500c19e.avif?t=1771983898 width=800 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last he remembered, 